WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Two tones reach your ears. One is four hundred hertz. One is four hundred and ten.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
You may perceive a third rhythm—the difference. But neither speaker plays that rhythm by itself.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:25.000
A perceptual beat is real as an experience. A changed EEG pattern is a separate measurement.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Research finds inconsistent entrainment results. One promising experiment does not certify a retail recording.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Before you buy an audio routine, ask what it contains—and what anyone has actually tested.
